01:03:26.408 --> 01:03:28.376
- How about a shiner, superstar?
DUSTIN: Oh, no.


01:03:28.543 --> 01:03:31.706
Won't be no bruising the moneymaker,
okay?


01:03:31.880 --> 01:03:35.213
You broke my best friend's heart.
Have a nice life.


01:03:35.383 --> 01:03:38.477
- Tami, I don't even know what I did wrong.
- Let me handle this, JP.


01:03:38.653 --> 01:03:40.712
He doesn't even know
what he did wrong.


01:03:40.889 --> 01:03:42.083
I just said that.


01:03:42.257 --> 01:03:44.225
I know, but it's all about
your intonation.


01:03:44.392 --> 01:03:47.225
Hey. She knows you cheated. Get it?


01:03:47.395 --> 01:03:50.922
- You're done.
- What? That's crazy. And not true.


01:03:51.600 --> 01:03:54.398
That's funny, because she saw you
with Natalia.


01:03:56.938 --> 01:03:58.200
Wait a second, hold on.


01:03:58.373 --> 01:04:02.002
So Mary was there
when Natalia broke into your house?


01:04:02.177 --> 01:04:03.701
No. No, nothing happened.


01:04:04.779 --> 01:04:07.475
Natalia busted into my parents' house.
She set me up.


01:04:08.116 --> 01:04:10.311
There's nothing going on between us.


01:04:10.485 --> 01:04:12.419
I would never hurt Mary like that.


01:04:13.221 --> 01:04:14.984
This is insane.
You have to believe me.


01:04:15.156 --> 01:04:18.023
Look, I want to believe you
and I want her to be happy.


01:04:18.193 --> 01:04:20.957
Especially now that she's stuck
with Dominique another year.


01:04:21.129 --> 01:04:23.256
Wait, she didn't get into Manhattan?


01:04:23.431 --> 01:04:26.366
- They didn't give her the audition.
- Oh, my God.


01:04:26.535 --> 01:04:29.834
- Why would they reject her?
- Guess they changed their mind.


01:04:32.874 --> 01:04:34.637
But we can change them back.


01:04:34.809 --> 01:04:36.504
- You can?
- You can?


01:04:37.579 --> 01:04:39.206
What's my name?


01:04:39.381 --> 01:04:41.144
- Joey Parker.
- What's my name?


01:04:41.316 --> 01:04:43.443
Ha. Joey Parker.


01:04:44.653 --> 01:04:46.780
Get Mary to come to the competition,
all right?


01:04:46.955 --> 01:04:48.752
I'll handle it from there.


01:04:51.159 --> 01:04:52.353
