01:07:05.960 --> 01:07:09.396
Sausage-fingered masses. Move.


01:07:09.564 --> 01:07:10.690
Get down. Go, go.


01:07:10.865 --> 01:07:13.629
Sweet roots, blondie. Hey, hey, hey.


01:07:13.802 --> 01:07:15.793
No. Grandpa, up. Up.


01:07:15.970 --> 01:07:17.801
There you go, old man. Move.


01:07:18.206 --> 01:07:22.040
All right, no eye contact, people.
Periphery only.


01:07:23.912 --> 01:07:25.004
