01:20:53.020 --> 01:20:55.614
<i>Bring the beat back once more</i>


01:20:55.789 --> 01:20:57.313
- <i>Let me see you do that</i>
- <i>Let me see you do that</i>


01:20:57.491 --> 01:20:59.391
<i>You're the new classic</i>


01:20:59.560 --> 01:21:01.926
- <i>You're the new P. Y.T.</i>
- <i>You're the new P. Y.T.</i>


01:21:02.096 --> 01:21:03.825
- <i>Stands for pretty, young</i>
- <i>Stands for pretty, young</i>


01:21:03.998 --> 01:21:06.558
- <i>You take a chance to believe in me</i>
- <i>You take a chance to believe in me</i>


01:21:06.734 --> 01:21:09.362
- <i>You're the new classic, fantastic</i>
- <i>You're the new classic, fantastic</i>


01:21:09.537 --> 01:21:11.164
- <i>Now you own this floor</i>
- <i>Now you own this floor</i>


01:21:11.338 --> 01:21:13.306
- <i>Bring the beat back once more</i>
- <i>Bring the beat back once more</i>


01:21:13.974 --> 01:21:16.340
- <i>And watch us while we do that</i>
- <i>And watch us while we do that</i>


01:21:16.544 --> 01:21:18.535
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:21:19.246 --> 01:21:20.543
[SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]


01:21:25.352 --> 01:21:26.717
DUSTIN:
Yeah.


01:21:26.887 --> 01:21:28.377
- All right, Mary!
- Yeah.


01:21:28.556 --> 01:21:30.524
You're showing off, Mary.


01:21:30.691 --> 01:21:32.716
Stop showing off.


01:21:52.580 --> 01:21:54.275
All right.


01:21:54.548 --> 01:21:57.881
Thank you. Check it out. I'm gonna let
the judges over there deliberate.


01:21:58.052 --> 01:22:00.077
And I'll be back in five short minutes...


01:22:00.254 --> 01:22:03.155
...with the name of our winner.
Make some noise.


01:22:04.858 --> 01:22:07.224
Mary, you...


01:22:07.394 --> 01:22:09.225
You were amazing.


01:22:10.331 --> 01:22:12.128
So were you.


01:22:13.167 --> 01:22:16.136
No, no. There's nothing going on
between me and Natalia, okay?


01:22:16.303 --> 01:22:19.534
I was ambushed.
I was set up by your stepsisters.


01:22:20.841 --> 01:22:22.536
I would never hurt you like that.


01:22:24.278 --> 01:22:26.576
Believe me, okay?


01:22:26.981 --> 01:22:29.381
And no matter what they do...


01:22:31.285 --> 01:22:33.378
...we were meant to be together.


01:22:43.497 --> 01:22:46.398
- I believe you.
- Good. Because I'm totally kissable.


01:22:46.567 --> 01:22:48.228
[LAUGHS]


01:22:49.603 --> 01:22:51.230
[SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]


01:22:56.076 --> 01:22:57.100
That's my cue.


01:22:57.878 --> 01:23:00.142
- Go.
- Okay.


01:23:03.584 --> 01:23:05.609
Everybody still here?


01:23:05.819 --> 01:23:08.117
No, no, no, I can't hear you. Come on.


01:23:08.288 --> 01:23:09.949
[CHEERING]


01:23:13.027 --> 01:23:16.963
Everybody that came out tonight, dancers.
Thank you so much. You're amazing.


01:23:17.131 --> 01:23:19.156
I love you.


01:23:19.733 --> 01:23:23.567
But there can only be one winner.
I have that name in my hand. Here we go.


01:23:24.104 --> 01:23:26.368
The winner of the competition...


01:23:27.074 --> 01:23:28.507
...is...


01:23:29.710 --> 01:23:33.111
- Oh, my God. Mary Santiago.
- What?


01:23:36.750 --> 01:23:38.775
JOEY:
Everybody give it up.


01:23:40.454 --> 01:23:42.285
- Yeah.
- Yeah.


01:23:46.126 --> 01:23:48.253
No, it's fixed. What, you rig it, Mary?


01:23:50.998 --> 01:23:52.090
La-la-la.


01:23:52.433 --> 01:23:54.628
- You're amazing.
- Hey.


01:23:54.802 --> 01:23:57.293
This isn't fair. I deserve this award.


01:23:59.707 --> 01:24:01.698
But you were really good, Mary.


01:24:03.610 --> 01:24:05.373
TAMI: Hey.
- Aah!


01:24:06.346 --> 01:24:08.280
DUSTIN:
Congratulations.


01:24:08.449 --> 01:24:11.077
Look, hey, those moves were so
redonkulous, Mary.


01:24:11.251 --> 01:24:13.310
And I have to say, Joey,
as your manager...


01:24:13.487 --> 01:24:16.547
...I have to say
I think you got your swagger back.


01:24:16.724 --> 01:24:18.214
DOMINIQUE: Move it.
- Oh.


01:24:18.392 --> 01:24:20.223
How dare you?


01:24:20.861 --> 01:24:25.491
How dare you embarrass me
and your sisters?


01:24:25.666 --> 01:24:28.658
How do you think
this makes us look, huh?


01:24:29.069 --> 01:24:32.561
You, our maid,
wins the Joey Parker competition?


01:24:32.740 --> 01:24:38.872
You have humiliated us in front
of the entire Los Angeles metropolitan area.


01:24:40.080 --> 01:24:42.708
Miss Santiago?
My name is Regina Cretikos.


01:24:42.883 --> 01:24:44.475
I'm with the Manhattan Academy.


01:24:45.486 --> 01:24:49.183
You danced spectacularly well
for someone with two broken legs.


01:24:50.991 --> 01:24:54.188
Wait. What do you mean,
two broken legs?


01:24:54.361 --> 01:24:55.623
Don't look at me like that.


01:24:55.796 --> 01:24:58.663
We'll talk about this later.
Don't you pull that face with me.


01:24:58.832 --> 01:25:00.595
Girls, come with me.


01:25:00.768 --> 01:25:02.201
[SCREAMS]


01:25:07.141 --> 01:25:08.608
[GROANING]


01:25:10.511 --> 01:25:11.910
Anyway...


01:25:12.079 --> 01:25:14.877
...we would be honored
if you would come study with us.


01:25:15.048 --> 01:25:18.540
- Full scholarship. Call me on Monday.
- Oh, my God.


01:25:19.119 --> 01:25:21.280
It worked, man.


01:25:28.428 --> 01:25:31.955
Britt? I seem to have broken things.


01:25:34.768 --> 01:25:35.757
Hello?


01:25:36.036 --> 01:25:37.628
TAMI:
Call me every day, okay?


01:25:37.805 --> 01:25:40.239
I don't know if I can handle senior year
without you.


01:25:40.407 --> 01:25:42.898
Give it a few months,
you'll pick me up in your jet.


01:25:43.076 --> 01:25:44.976
- And we'll go shopping in Paris.
- Okay.


01:25:45.145 --> 01:25:46.908
DOMINIQUE:
I need my meds.


01:25:47.080 --> 01:25:49.776
P-R-O-N-T-O, pronto.


01:25:49.950 --> 01:25:52.578
Mary, did you hear me?


01:25:52.753 --> 01:25:55.415
Not the OxoCollon, that's for breakfast.


01:25:55.589 --> 01:25:57.989
I need my morphine, it's lunch time.


01:25:58.158 --> 01:26:00.023
Mary. Come on.


01:26:00.194 --> 01:26:02.822
Mary. A little help here, please.


01:26:04.565 --> 01:26:07.159
Sorry, Dominique.
I don't work for you anymore.


01:26:07.935 --> 01:26:09.960
- Oh, come on.
- Hey.


01:26:10.137 --> 01:26:14.335
Mary, aren't we BFFFFs or...?
Isn't that what the kids say?


01:26:14.508 --> 01:26:16.772
I can't believe all my dreams
are coming true.


01:26:16.944 --> 01:26:18.605
DOMINIQUE:
I know I can be a witch.


01:26:18.779 --> 01:26:20.474
You shouldn't be so sensitive.


01:26:20.647 --> 01:26:22.911
Don't you dare get in that van, Mary.


01:26:23.283 --> 01:26:24.341
Mary?


01:26:24.518 --> 01:26:27.510
Mary, don't leave me with these people.


01:26:27.688 --> 01:26:29.952
Don't be my frienemy!


01:26:30.123 --> 01:26:32.114
[GASPING]


01:26:32.292 --> 01:26:34.624
Oh, I'm feeling something.


01:26:35.062 --> 01:26:37.007
I'm feeling
abandoned.


01:26:46.740 --> 01:26:47.832
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:26:48.008 --> 01:26:49.032
Shh.


01:26:51.078 --> 01:26:52.636
[DANCE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:29:12.352 --> 01:29:14.343
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:31:59.886 --> 01:32:01.877
Subtitles by LeapinLar

